{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players will play as a warrior with unique skills, using automatic attacks to carve a path through levels filled with monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">During \u95ef\u5173 (level progression), players face a constant onslaught of monsters. As levels advance, the difficulty increases gradually, with the number and strength of monsters \u4e0d\u65ad (continuously) rising. Players can collect coins and diamonds by defeating monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Coins can be used in the in-game store to upgrade various powerful attributes, while diamonds unlock advanced warrior skills, enable summoning of powerful pets, and allow purchasing other hero characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game includes a sign-in system, offering rich rewards. There is also a dungeon system, where playing dungeons yields more rewards to enhance player strength, as well as a mission system and a lucky draw system, ensuring an engaging player experience.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3791820?t=1749710349","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791820/e32ca1a49625cba39fcaa1dbc93813416db03eea/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749710349","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791820/bbaf331be2e82d21ee8b90469801678ee9ade88b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749710349","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791820/bbaf331be2e82d21ee8b90469801678ee9ade88b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749710349","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players will play as a warrior with unique skills, using automatic attacks to carve a path through levels filled with monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">During \u95ef\u5173 (level progression), players face a constant onslaught of monsters. As levels advance, the difficulty increases gradually, with the number and strength of monsters \u4e0d\u65ad (continuously) rising. Players can collect coins and diamonds by defeating monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Coins can be used in the in-game store to upgrade various powerful attributes, while diamonds unlock advanced warrior skills, enable summoning of powerful pets, and allow purchasing other hero characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game includes a sign-in system, offering rich rewards. There is also a dungeon system, where playing dungeons yields more rewards to enhance player strength, as well as a mission system and a lucky draw system, ensuring an engaging player experience.</p>","developers":["\u65e0\u9650\u5200\u4f20\u5947"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791820/138c69d69cd50cd2550ea744b51dcbb87c470a75/header.jpg?t=1749710349","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257155810,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257155810/movie480.mp4?t=1749709536","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257155810/movie_max.mp4?t=1749709536"},"name":"wxdcq1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257155810/ad23039d8bdae62721bbd088594d06fd777f93f3/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749709536","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257155810/movie480_vp9.webm?t=174970953